  "description": "Firmstrong offers the most versatile range of beach cruiser bikes for men specifically engineered for comfort and durability. The Bruiser is a favorite among men looking for that recreational cruiser to fit the true needs of a guy. The Bruiser name suits it well as this is a guys guy bike.\n\nThe Bruiser is a single speed cruiser with no cables hanging off the bike or complicated gear systems. This bike is a no frills cruiser bicycle that does as advertised and makes bike rides fun relaxing and comfortable. The ride is smooth and effortless as the wide tires and spring saddle make the ride soft and comfortable. The brake system is a coaster brake which means the rider pedals backwards to stop just like the original beach cruisers.\n\nDont let the one gear fool you as it will be able to serve the differing needs of various riders. While only one gear riders will still be able to maintain a consistent cruising speed from 5 to 15mph. In addition riding up hills is achievable because of the single speed configuration and ergonomic design.\n\nThe design is catered to the true man with the thick top tube design extended length frame and all black components. The frame has an extra two inches of length compared to a standard cruiser design giving riders more distance from the handlebars and better arm extension. This model fits most men 5 foot 4 inches to 6 foot 4 inches tall and is designed in Hermosa Beach California.\n\n- Designed for Tall Riders (Fits 5'4\" - 6'4\")\n\n- 100% Satisfaction Guarantee\n\n19” Extended Length Steel Frame with 26” Aluminum Wheels\n\nGreat recreational riding bike for taller men or those who would like more arm extension. 2” extended frame creates more space between rider and handlebars.\n\nThick top tube design gives a “Beefy” look to this men’s cruiser bike\n\nAll Black Components\n\nSingle Speed Bike with a Pedal-Backwards Coaster Brake for easy pedaling and smooth braking\n\nDual Spring Oversized Seat for Added Comfort\n\n2.125” Wide All Black Tires provides a cushioned, relaxed ride for easy rolling\n\n28.5” Wide Painted Black Cruiser Bike Handlebars with Synthetic Leather Black Grips\n\nBicycle Weighs approximately 40lbs. Fully Assembled\n\nFits Most Men 5’4” – 6’4” Tall\n\nRecommended Riding Speed 3 – 15mph\n\nRecommended Riding Distance 0 – 20 miles in a single trip\n\nThe Seat and Handlebar Height and Tilt can be adjusted to properly fit the rider\n\nColor Matched Fenders can be Purchased Separately for $49.99.\n\nBike comes 80% Assembled, Assembly is easy and fun!\n\nDesigned in Hermosa Beach, CA.",
